2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"알겠습니다.","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알겠습니다","audio":"/audio/d0b5eebde68b9538543c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/89921e15623dfc44e2af.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.718,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=13966","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":63,"sequenceScore":1.5447,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好的，我明白了。","如果电脑系统出现问题，请立刻联系我们。","还没听到关于你母亲的消息呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["如果电脑系统出现问题，请立刻联系我们。","还没听到关于你母亲的消息呢。","好的，我明白了。"],"answer":2}]}
